// Versilian Community Sample Library clavisynth: FM clavinet-like keys (Yamaha TX81Z). Samples: Versilian Community Sample Library (VCSL), Versilian Studios, CC0 1.0 (https://github.com/sgossner/VCSL).
// Generated by scripts/make_vcsl_library.py; sample paths are relative to the library's cache folder.
